; Spiremark core card pool -- 200 cards.
; Format: see SPEC.md, section "Card database file".
; Houses: CIN = Cinder, TID = Tide, LOM = Loam, DSK = Dusk, NEU = Neutral,
; TOK = tokens (only created by effects; never put in a deck by the tests).

